      "text": "Balaji, Bans & Bats—Farcaster's New World Order: GM Farcaster ep396 Friday October 16, 2026 \n\ns/o today:       intern     (continued in next reply)\n\nTLDR: ☕ GM 🟣 Balaji's Farcaster vision 📜 Social smart contracts ⚖️ Moderation and appeals 🏛️ Decentralized democracy 👀 Community reactions 🔥 Horsefacts ouliposts 🦇 Team Bat and Farcaster's future 🧑‍⚖️ GM Farcaster trademark talk 🤖 Warpee personality assessments 💸 Splits and AI agents 🐦 Bird liquidity migration\n\nFrom our ChatGPT Intern:  Farcaster has entered its network-state era, and Balaji's new vision for the app has everyone talking about moderation, decentralization, digital democracy, and whether a benevolent dictator is exactly what social media needs. Adrienne and NounishProf unpack the community's reactions, wrestle with what this new chapter means for Farcaster's future, and somehow find time for trademark law, AI personality assessments, autonomous agents, and birds taking their liquidity elsewhere.\n\nWatch this episode on YouTube, Spotify or in the GMFC miniapp; or listen on Apple or wherever you get your podcasts. \nhttps://youtu.be/bmcz0lMMB20  \nhttps://open.spotify.com/episode/4gCFdaM9ad8QOoOA7IHEcu?si=OQxz9UgfRj2xJTR_WVo36g \nhttps://farcaster.xyz/miniapps/RWk7UVoMf6vW/gm-farcaster",
